<html><head><title></title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><span style="font-family: Verdana, sans-serif">You are almost back at the foot of the mountain. Around you, other peaks are waiting to be climbed as well. In new collaborations, you can always use the TRAIL again as a guide for the process. Be proud of what you have achieved during this journey and see it as motivation to climb more, new mountains. Perhaps the next journey goes smoother, but never without challenges. That makes the slightly unpredictable transdisciplinary projects so realistic: urgent, valuable, and always inspiring.</span></body></html>